#X text 240 83 The object mixes two colors and outputs the result.
The mixing ratio is set with a float on the left inlet (0 - first color
\, 1 - second color \, values in between give a smooth blend). The
two source colors are set with the C0 and C1 arguments \, via the @c0
and @c1 properties \, or through the middle and right inlets.;
